  "body": "**Blocked by:** none\n\n## Context\n\nSecond standalone smoke-test issue for the generalized multi-project agent\ndispatch pipeline, this time specifically to confirm the opencode/DeepSeek\nusage-reporting fix (token totals summed across all `step_finish` events).\nNot part of the founding `[NN/22]` batch, no relationship to any other issue.\n\n## Task\n\nCreate a new file `docs/pipeline-smoke-test-2.md` containing exactly this\ncontent (one line, plus a trailing newline):\n\n```\nSemprec agent pipeline smoke test 2 — opencode usage reporting verified.\n```\n\n## Scope\n\n### In scope\n- Creating the single file `docs/pipeline-smoke-test-2.md` with the exact\n  content specified above.\n\n### Out of scope\n- Any other file, schema, dependency, or code change.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- `docs/pipeline-smoke-test-2.md` exists on `develop` after merge.\n- Its content is exactly the single line `Semprec agent pipeline smoke test 2 — opencode usage reporting verified.` (plus a trailing newline).\n- No other files are modified by this issue's PR.\n",
